==Greek==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|grc|el}} {{term|lang=grc|ἀλήθεια|tr=alētheia}}

===Pronunciation===
* [[Wiktionary:About Greek/Pronunciation|IPA]]: {{IPAchar|[aˈliθça]}}

===Noun===
{{el-noun|f|alítheia|αλήθειες|alítheies|sort=αληθεια}}
# [[truth]]

====Declension====
{{el-nF-α-ες-3b2|αλήθει|αληθει}}

====Usage notes====
The phrase '''είναι αλήθεια''' corresponds to the English '''it is true'''

====Related terms====
