* {{el-l|αληθώς|tr=alithós|gloss=truly, really|sc=Grek}}
* {{el-l|αληθινά|tr=alithiná|gloss=truly, veritably|sc=Grek}}
* {{el-l|αληθής|tr=alithís|gloss=true}} {{qualifier|in Boolean logic}}
* {{el-l|αληθινός|tr=alithinós|gloss=true}} {{qualifier|of a statement, story, etc}}
* {{el-l|αληθοφανής|tr=alithofanís|gloss=plausable, apparently true|sc=Grek}}

===Adverb===
{{el-adv|alítheia}}

# [[really]], [[truly]]

